  EntryData:
    entries:
    - name: Gate Keeper
      icon: {fileID: -958849402, guid: c9f5870882a2f3642a3d072d9cb86e4d, type: 3}
      dialogueStrips:
      - "So, you\u2019re the so-called Savior everyone\u2019s whispering about..."
      - "I don\u2019t buy into titles. Not until I see them earned."
      - "The path ahead is unforgiving - it\u2019s chaos out there."
      - Chess piece invaders have overrun the territory, set up camps. Any order
        out there has long passed.
      - "If you want to continue up the bookshelf, you must prove you\u2019re more
        than just talk."
      - "Do that, and maybe I\u2019ll start believing the rumors."
      - ...
      - "Good luck. You\u2019ll need it."
